{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"6119","title":"Xiaomi Fan Festival 2026 Kicks Off, Empowering Users to Enjoy Seamlessly Smart Living","desc":"Held annually on April 6 to celebrate Xiaomi's birthday, the XFF spans from late March through April, featuring a series of online and offline promotions and events to express gratitude to Xiaomi's global fans for their enduring support.","view_cnt":"12044","like_cnt":"4","add_time":"1774596252","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/667_operatorx_operatorx_opx/27/03/2026/09417bb98fc148dcc79bd49cad3bcfb6.jpg"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBeijing, CHINA, March 31, 2026 – \u003c/strong\u003eXiaomi today announced its 2026 Xiaomi Fan Festival (XFF). Held annually on April 6 to celebrate Xiaomi's birthday, the XFF spans from late March through April, featuring a series of online and offline promotions and events to express gratitude to Xiaomi's global fans for their enduring support. Guided by Xiaomi's \"Human × Car × Home\" strategy, this year's theme, 'Smart Living, Made Yours', aims to bring greater simplicity, efficiency, and comfort to users' lives.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/896_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/27/03/2026/9e796bde7ce7652b9b5998a08fa4c09d.jpg\" alt=\"A promotional image for the Xiaomi Fan Festival features various smart devices, including a washing machine, smartphone, smartwatch, earbuds, a television, and a robotic vacuum. The background has a soft gradient, and the text highlights the event dates from March 31 to April 30, 2026, with the tagline \u0026quot;Smart Living, Made Yours.\u0026quot;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eIn September 2025, Xiaomi debuted its Mijia home appliance portfolio globally for the first time, including Mijia Refrigerator Cross Door 502L, Mijia Front Load Washer Dryer Pro 9kg, and Mijia Air Conditioner Pro Eco Series. The Xiaomi Smart Home Appliances Factory in Wuhan also went into operation in October, strengthening manufacturing and supply capabilities. By 2025, Xiaomi's smart home appliances had expanded into four major global regions and 14 markets, advancing the \"Human × Car × Home\" strategy and helping bring smarter living experiences to more users.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExclusive offers across global platforms\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eAs a special thank-you to Xiaomi Fans loyal and new, Xiaomi is rolling out exclusive festival promotions across multiple platforms worldwide. Get ready to discover fantastic deals on popular Xiaomi products—special discounts, coupons, and more await you on \u003c/span\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.mi.com/global/\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003emi.com\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e, Amazon, Shopee, Lazada, and TikTok Shop, as well as at Xiaomi Stores.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eInteractive campaigns worldwide\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eBeyond great deals, Xiaomi is also inviting users around the world to help shape the future of smart living. The highlight of this year's festival is the #SmartLivingMadeYours online campaign. From April 6 to 20, users can share their innovative thoughts on next-generation Xiaomi smart home appliances through the brand's official social media channels. On Xiaomi Community, fans can post photos or short videos showing how Xiaomi products make everyday life easier and depict concept products that they love Xiaomi will bring to life, with a chance to win exclusive prizes.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecial rewards in selected countries\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eIn addition to the global campaign, fans in selected markets can look forward to even more exclusive rewards. In Spain, France, Germany, Poland, and Malaysia, the #YourSmartLivingOnUs campaign offers a chance to win big. Simply share their shopping carts and write their 'Smart Living Wish Stories' on TikTok, Facebook, or Instagram. One lucky winner can have their entire cart cleared up within $5,000—while 10 others win up to $500.*\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eIt's the perfect opportunity for everyone to step into a smarter life with Xiaomi. For detailed terms and conditions, please visit \u003c/span\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.mi.com/global/\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003emi.com.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA celebration with Xiaomi Fans\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eOriginating in Mainland China in 2012, XFF has grown into a truly global celebration that now reaches more than 50 countries and regions around the world.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eToday, Xiaomi serves hundreds of millions of users globally, and will continue to bring fans together to celebrate innovation, explore a fully interconnected smart living ecosystem, and enjoy a smarter, more convenient life.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDisclaimer\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e* Prize values and terms may vary by market. For more information, please visit the regional website and official social media.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eENDS\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAbout Xiaomi Corporation\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eXiaomi Corporation was founded in April 2010 and listed on the Main Board of the Hong Kong Stock Exchange on July 9, 2018 (1810.HK). Xiaomi is a consumer electronics and smart manufacturing company with smartphones and smart hardware connected by an IoT platform at its core.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eEmbracing our vision of \"Make friends with users and be the coolest company in the users' hearts\", Xiaomi continuously pursues innovations, high-quality user experience and operational efficiency. The Company relentlessly builds amazing products with honest prices to let everyone in the world enjoy a better life through innovative technology.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eXiaomi is one of the world's leading smartphone companies. In December 2025, the MAU reached 754.1 million (including smartphones and tablets) globally. The Company has also established the world's leading consumer AIoT (AI+IoT) platform. As of December 31, 2025, the number of IoT devices connected to its platform (excluding smartphones, laptops and tablets) reached 1,079.2 million. In October 2023, Xiaomi upgraded its strategy to \"Human × Car × Home\" smart ecosystem, seamlessly merging personal devices, smart home products, and cars. Xiaomi always centers on humanity and is committed to providing comprehensive, better connected experiences. Xiaomi products are present in more than 100 countries and regions around the world. In July 2025, Xiaomi was included in the Fortune Global 500 list for the seventh year in a row, ranking 297th.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eXiaomi is a constituent of the Hang Seng Index, Hang Seng China Enterprises Index, Hang Seng TECH Index and Hang Seng China 50 Index.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"7233","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1774926847"},"common":null}